# Noetherian projective spectra

The projective spectrum of a graded algebra generated by finitely many degree-one elements over
a Noetherian degree-zero ring is a Noetherian scheme.

## Main results

* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.Proj.isNoetherian_proj` gives Noetherianity of the projective
  spectrum of a Noetherian graded ring.

## Implementation notes

Finite generation over the Noetherian degree-zero ring makes the whole graded ring Noetherian,
so the cited result covers the degree-one-generated case.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0AG6](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0AG6)
